#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html
msgid "The three built-in groups (Administrator, User, Kids) cannot be edited or removed — they define what the roles mean app-wide. Custom groups are additive: a member keeps everything their role grants and gains what the group adds. If a group names specific library locations, its members are restricted to those."
